+	  Load_Advances (Normal)     4.645 us/op
+	  Load_Advances (Fast)       0.027 us/op
+	  Render                     2.789 us/op
+	  Get_Glyph                  0.460 us/op
+	  Get_CBox                   0.077 us/op
+	  Get_Char_Index             0.024 us/op
+	  Iterate CMap              13.403 us/op
